ile Highers are not meant to rule other humans - and show no particular will to do so - they are frequently called to higher duties.\n\t\tTheir nature grants them better senses than other humans.\n\t\tIncrease blindness immunity by %d%%, maximum sight range by %d, and increases existing infravision, and heightened senses range by %d.\n\t\tAt talent level 5, each time you hit a target you gain telepathy to all similar creatures in radius 15 for 5 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"虽然高等人类的高贵血统并不意味着统治他人——他们也没有特别的意愿去那样做——但是他们经常承担更高的义务。\n\t\t他们的本能使得他们比别人有更强的直觉。\n\t\t增加 %d%% 目盲免疫，提高 %d 点最大视野范围并提高 %d 夜视及感应范围。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，每次你命中目标，你将获得 15 格范围内同类型生物感知能力，持续 5 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a8ccc428e971669ba74065b6991901f0108b526a5c61d7d60a0e5ac8e2f10de5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"566e17cdb5772a3ec8928abfc82013067431c7fa3ff220946ccc933452efff09","logical_entry_identity":"4868d392c7923b0f54495bfc06f7eec96123e0d6449b6bb02aa39e5a7f5f344b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"multi-hued ring","source_tag":"_t","target":"多彩戒指"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12e8e0b02d0a9771ebc3d2b982e46df5f43bf0368efd4ce3180ec11cb0e48e86","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"567436f5b2879c47210926a0123f1d8748d63302dadadf58b32dcb1c67d0ead7","logical_entry_identity":"65ec86f95d9527196de971442c0e379bfb07f272e023faf00b339d96e0748ecb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"health","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"健康"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9bf21037bed879cd07c6b2792fed6977a33c715c69170aa8b2402e7875c0b347","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5679ea5cc102deb12b7caf9c5d570dac4d4e7e068eb6f6fe5945f7a66cc32b42","logical_entry_identity":"ae4622d2907052ad93548625261a9efeb28d8bb23f4bd2abcffdeb3a5f397184","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"shadow stalker","source_tag":"entity name","target":"阴影潜行者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81ba0c4435a71d70b99deac3669a21a429b58191076ec6a16f5daf3a3a663562","component":"tome"