t","target":"好的，让我看看你的货物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d2c059a24ec9225ef7ba20a8c2ec4b8add4793c001a8443832882c5e42f8e0e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56c554052773a9d99de93e6b1d22890fc3fbf9b9b22158ddcce096f82e3ae846","logical_entry_identity":"41f76b78a91b52810407047ffeac1ed77256fb54dc115dc729ac9c5ffcf03718","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"crescent blade","source_tag":"_t","target":"月牙形匕首"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b83feaefc1d6f8ad0fa15ef80a994cd6b28418ed0239fd3e979bfab919c2ed5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56c582df10c543bf84d95bdd55dbe463e2db3993b4e16acda43e3a6f410bb31e","logical_entry_identity":"d7f3bb5c3eca5a1a909245ed4eb02a6c1114a9bc7352babdaf6bb608a2db76c2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rethread","source_tag":"talent name","target":"重组"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d0ce001833339b4455a192f1db87a60b80e4b36081d0ffaec1ecf32e99494775","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56c8306d1e0f047db4fba0960f4996617227210254db847a367d6c5d0e76e07c","logical_entry_identity":"4dcfbf2a26679d7004f02e8f2ca15c03a9b72be371c5229489583d6542b4c098","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A large and muscled wolf from the northern wastes. Its breath is cold and icy, and its fur coated in frost.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一头来自北部荒野的狼，它膘肥身健，体型匀称。它呼吸冰冷，毛覆寒霜。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6a9bf26d557192fecbfde9ee324e5d467e30fcf6cc933b6372fefa1916c6078","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56ca93424cccf1f4d7107284bba8cf8b9a5745e4b3d6b67086fa438fdf7af912","logical_entry_identity":"6028e5ca653a208e47b982932a42177c56cc4f988ffe1fd32d82b436a9a9b134","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"High Thaumaturgist","source_tag":"_t","target":"高阶奇术师"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12ff45cac1696453a3d065268a60528f8a699e719037d097dca88856509803a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56cddba67d39bdac6e8aebc56ecedd519a189201c8920b3f5d2cdca189d9f9ce","logical_entry_identity":"4e1b69cc7798eb5c9adac5e133dd62124b9769d6ea94bd30d7f3bef8f0fad48a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Absorption Strike","source_tag":"_t","target":"-吸能一击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ff7872f7bf30abc06882dbe670824ce627eb0840c6d1fb8af5331d77132e256","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56d236ee6ba1360adeca65f2ccf72902fe52c05e3fe84665a72f0d2f3dca4244","logical_entry_identity":"254f4cfc7c55af00c979b8ff2a606338e5e6fb224a01259157bf7938281e05e2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stealthy ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"潜行的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"037dc4064f800a876261776d4ca2885b8a5db2c92fa2f182132aa2e08c5b187f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56d5388e27d25a9e3ddaf0e1d0418d678c6cdcf723831d3be4719c13312b0406","logical_entry_identity":"2a8c08669410e33fff1179b6c65d8edcbd7e5ce1d48b357a283f926caa7becdb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Good adventurer, I am an alchemist, and quite a good one. This year, for the first time, the great Brotherhood of Alchemists has invited my application to their number. I'll not try your patience with the details of the application process, but suffice to say that it is grueling. Fortunately, a mere three tasks now stand between me and acceptance.","source_tag":"_t","target":"可敬的冒险者，我是一名炼金术士，而且手艺相当精湛。今年，伟大的炼金术士兄弟会首次邀请我申请入会。我就不用申请流程的细节来消磨你的耐心了，简而言之，那极其严苛。幸运的是，现在我与正式入会之间只剩下区区三项任务了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0884ff36d3c124873c522e3a558fd5db4a285210fc25dd4196f734988fd2953","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56d688d85ea14c3b3a574ef4e26b9ffbec5675c048fab9ce683f303430909a5b","logical_entry_identity":"25a6ad9846f7b74f2103cfb410ffe82f86def00f1d9f00b66bd5fccd4b6cb4fe","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A small faceless humanoid with vaguely Dwarven features.  Its waraxe and shield look battered, rusted, and generally in ill repair.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个没有面孔、身材矮小且带有部分矮人特征的人形怪物。它的战斧和盾牌看起来破旧、生锈，几乎从未修理过。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b087ce3b17c88269adcdf34a9fe855f4e98b22160c8a3c8aa070e56a4675e320","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56d9fc7aaabfe430b1a88f683223e996f3e19e89b3fd892ed0c18d07b654746a","logical_entry_identity":"abb0ebeaeba4e389c8ddb764e57a49f3adf093fd531b188d489daac042b856e7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enter the tunnels","source_tag":"_t","target":"进入通道"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8ed2d1215e807ae22bba0a1e275f063c000592d27fcb93d1935120a786136491","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56dad9b1c301cbc077389fd4f79504f1f9b26e445ac73f7dc78dce1ce3f69912","logical_entry_identity":"a50c0e5376e588e62ef3242fe3e5a4c7279a6a355b06052367faa8bee4154cd5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Destroyed your own Shade.","source_tag":"_t","target":"击败你自己的影子。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8806b5c23a8736e3dac42950bcf811363c54c1df4751e40f453b5ddea48c78dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56dd2f07563642aa29cc8a02f052b8f8f5e8f18cc0c11185073a435feb8a8762","logical_entry_identity":"ce91ca57c97a6cf81e00747dbcc693116d05b78c97193e3d537eb113ec409f26","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are a citizen of the Sunwall, and like many of your age you have been trained in combat and magic. It can be a harsh life, and though you dream at times of venturing to distant lands you know your duty is to help defend the outpost against the vicious onslaught from the Orc Prides. But now High Sun Paladin Aeryn has advised you of a new threat.\n\nNagas have been sighted in the Slazish Fens on the other side of the Sunwall Mountains. Their objective is unclear, but an assault from both sides would be truly devastating at such a pivotal time for your people. Though there are few forces to spare on the front line against the Prides, you have volunteered to investigate the naga threat and stop them if need be.\n\nBy the power of the Sun and the blessings of the Moons you step forth to find your fate.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你是太阳堡垒的成员，和许多同龄人一样，你受过战斗与魔法训练。\n这是一段残酷的生活，你有时梦想去遥远的土地冒险，但你也知道你的使命是帮助抵御兽人部落凶猛的攻势、保卫前哨站。但现在，高阶太阳骑士艾琳告诉了你一个新的威胁。\n\n在太阳堡垒群山的另一边斯拉伊什沼泽发现了娜迦的踪迹。他们的目的还未查明，但在这个对你的人民至关重要的时刻，如果同时受到两边夹击，后果将是毁灭性的。\n但是已经很难从前线对付兽人部落的部队里抽调人员了，你自愿前去调查娜迦的威胁，如有必要就阻止他们。\n\n在太阳之力和月亮的祝福下，你迈步向前寻找你的宿命。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7db90be4c27fa1562857e387f7b226e4fd4d66d0c0f391d0c63c51d7f4ab281","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56dd6670719e8a1c85e6182db95790c30fccf7952d501f60b2d8c0adda93fa14","logical_entry_identity":"02ec7a3e3473a0dd3be038d6e3c52ff35ce33e1032f19f6ce53b0fd31e60809a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"rampage","source_tag":"talent type","target":"暴走"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8fa89e19ac93b4d2cf651404225ed2a4837c4beb450b8dc5d5ebdc7c36ec14c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56e44a7913ee71863da47fb6affe709e8568550e81d079647e2af6f3b39e05c3","logical_entry_identity":"be200164634a78cf5ace03dd50bcf0cb0b98d27fe258e78667c88a47ea73f711","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mighty Blows","source_tag":"_t","target":"猛力攻击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ce01e489d16906f106f37fc8fe4e85b06adf886c276fa3a662363455a19bb828","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56e6baea0576bc3a077a0c46507a87cd0909db9740d6f8d2346538e65ef5044c","logical_entry_identity":"a3a8eaa7dd4dd581f7d9a220bee7bddebf12f8a50a5c740ec888eaf70f2bcc00","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The orb seems to fizzle without the Blood Master.","source_tag":"log","target":"没有血之领主在场，水晶球似乎只是发出嘶嘶声，无法生效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c9e2274e417c9df7e95326c8e969b70a2c935a424657a1dda9a90dcadea44cbc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"56e9fa0022690720b32cdd28e0b1cca380bfdb6d28525ad3e228e03552030007","logical_entry_identity":"9168660333a5561a5ee5b0a14eaba51e57a37ddd66ce8b84c566abb7f6654fae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Focused Wrath","source_tag":"_t","target":"集火"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2818e03e9c